- # Shown in-frame when a legacy (LTI 1.1) launch reaches a deep-linking
- # placement. Deep linking is 1.3-only (see LtiDeepLinking#render_deep_link_legacy),
- # and a blank 403 inside Canvas's picker modal would explain nothing. One word
- # from the existing picker refusal is all it says: this path is defensive (a
- # 1.1 install gets no import placement), so it carries no copy of its own. The
- # 403 status is kept so the refusal stays visible as one.
.lti-iframe__landing
  = image_tag '/assets/images/wiki-logo.png', alt: 'Wiki Education Dashboard', class: 'lti-iframe__logo'
  %h1.lti-iframe__title= t('lti.deep_link.unavailable_header')
